SUMMARY:Mini Makers: Fall 2026 Term 1
LOCATION:Pensacola Museum of Art: Classroom\, 407 S Jefferson St.\, Pensaco
 la\, FL 32502
DESCRIPTION:Thursdays · 2:00 PM to 3:00 PM\n\nMini Makers is an eight week
  art program for ages 4 to 6 at the Pensacola Museum of Art. It uses varie
 d\, sensory materials and tactile activities. Instructor Marce Wagner\, kn
 own as Ms. Messy\, leads Thursday classes from 2:00 PM to 3:00 PM. Term 1 
 runs August 27 through October 15 and costs $96 for museum members or $110
  for non-members. Term 2 follows October 22 through December 17. The term 
 ends with an artwork showcase for family.\n\nPrice: from $110\n\nDetails: 
 https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-mini-makers-fall-2026-term-1-0827.h
 tml
URL:https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-mini-makers-fall-2026-term-1-082
 7.html
