SUMMARY:Make & Take Art: weekly drop-in art sessions
LOCATION:Mobile Museum of Art\, 4850 Museum Drive\, Mobile\, AL 36608
DESCRIPTION:Thursdays 8/27 through 10/15 (except Sept 8) · 3:00 PM to 4:30
  PM\n\nThe museum runs a free Thursday afternoon art session most weeks\, 
 working through materials and techniques borrowed from artists on view. Pr
 ojects range from geometric shape painting to a Basquiat-inspired dinosaur
  build. The printed schedule also lists a session for September 8\, but th
 at date falls on a Tuesday\, not a Thursday\, so check with the museum fir
 st.\n\nPrice: Free\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-mobi
 le-museum-make-take-art.html
