DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20261006T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20261006T120000
SUMMARY:Next Generation Homeschool Art: Ages 7-9\, Tuesday Mornings
LOCATION:Pensacola Museum of Art: Classroom\, 407 S Jefferson St.\, Pensaco
 la\, FL 32502
DESCRIPTION:Tuesdays · 10:00 AM to 12:00 PM\n\nNext Generation Homeschool 
 Art is a visual arts course for ages 7 to 9 that follows National Visual A
 rts Standards. Group A meets Tuesday mornings from 10:00 AM to 12:00 PM at
