SUMMARY:Carnival of the Animals: Ballet Pensacola (Foo Foo Fest)
LOCATION:The Clark Family Cultural Center\, 400 S Jefferson St\, Pensacola\
 , FL 32502
DESCRIPTION:Sun 11/1\, Mon 11/2\, Tue 11/3 · see showtimes\n\nCarnival of 
 the Animals is an original family ballet set to Saint-Saens's score\, danc
 ed by Ballet Pensacola's Student Company and Youth Ensemble. Animal puppet
 s and projections tell the story of a child's dream\, and the show ends wi
 th an interactive Parade of Animals with friends of the Humane Society. It
  is part of the Foo Foo Festival and is made for audiences of every age.\n
 \nPrice: No published price\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventures.com/event
 s/ev-ballet-carnival-animals-1101.html
