 8 who attend local public schools interpret jazz music at the Monte L. Moo
 rer/Spring Hill Branch Library. The JAWS Festival put the exhibit together
  with the Mobile Arts Council and the Amp Up Arts Program\, and it hangs a
 ll day from November 1 through December 15\, so there is no single event w
 indow to catch.\n\nPrice: No published price\n\nDetails: https://coastalev
 entures.com/events/ev-jazz-art-writers-south-festival-youth-exhibi-0801.ht
