SUMMARY:Great Gulfcoast Arts Festival
LOCATION:Seville Square\, 311 E Government St\, Pensacola\, FL 32502
DESCRIPTION:Fri 11/6 to Sun 11/8 · 9 AM to 5 PM Fri and Sat\, 9 AM to 4 PM
  Sun\n\nThe Great Gulfcoast Arts Festival fills Seville Square with more t
 han 200 juried painters\, potters\, sculptors\, jewellers and other artist
 s over three days. Live music plays from the main stage\, heritage artists
  demonstrate traditional crafts\, and the Children's Arts Festival has fre
 e hands-on projects. Admission is free. Pets are not allowed\, and downtow
 n parking is tight\, so plan to walk in from a distance.\n\nPrice: Free\n\
 nDetails: https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-great-gulfcoast-arts-fest
 ival-1106.html
